\date{2026-02-05T14:40:45Z}
\tag{discrete}
\taxon{Remark}

\import{discrete-macros}

\p{Dually to #{\forall}, we can think of #{\exists} as being like a big “or”. That is, ##{\ext{x}{D} P(x) \equiv P(x_1) \lor P(x_2) \lor P(x_3) \lor
    \dots} where #{x_1}, #{x_2}, #{x_3}, ... are all the elements of the domain #{D}.}
